<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49665" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ultor</span></b> , ōris, m.
		ulciscor, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a punisher</i>, <i>avenger</i>, <i>revenger.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen. (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conjurationis investigator atque ultor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Sull. 30, 85</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Publius nostrarum injuriarum ultor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Brut. 77, 268</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Pis. 10, 23</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exoriare aliquis nostris ex ossibus ultor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 4, 625</span></i>
			.—Attributively, <i><span class="en">Ov. Ib.
			340</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">deus ultor = Anteros,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					M. 14, 750</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ultores dii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					4, 57</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ultore ferro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just.
					4, 18, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ultores ignes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop. 4, 1, 115</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sil. 2, 495</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Ultor, a surname of Mars, <i>the Avenger</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. F. 5,
				577</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 3, 18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Aug. 21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">29</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id.
				Calig. 24 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Inscr.
					Grut. 121, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">232</span></i>
			<i>med.</i>; 317, 8.</div>
